# Regenerable build inputs.
#
# Everything here is produced by `npm run build`: screenshots from the live
# deployment, narration from the TTS engine, subtitles and the intermediate
# render work. They are large binaries, they change on every run, and committing
# them would bloat the repository for no benefit — the generators are the source
# of truth.
assets/
audio/
.work/
manifest.json
narration.json
*.log

# The rendered deliverables in `out/` are deliberately committed: the README
# links to them, so they must exist in the repository.
